# Constable's linter.
#
# Nondeterminism is caught here, at edit time, rather than discovered in CI three
# weeks later: bare `sleep`, unfrozen Time.now/Date.today, unstubbed network
# calls, shared mutable state, conditional assertions, retry helpers.
#
# The cops are scoped to native Constable::Case files only. A file inheriting
# from Constable::ColdCase::* is exempt by design -- cold cases are how a legacy
# suite adopts Constable without a rewrite, and holding them to native rules on
# day one would defeat that entirely.
require:
  - rubocop-constable
